{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hant",
  "strings": {
    "%@失敗（錯誤代碼 %@）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ failed (error %2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（自動）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (Auto)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 企業伺服器：%@（伺服器 %@）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- Enterprise server: %@ (server %@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 顯示卡：%@；whisper：%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- Graphics: %1$@; whisper: %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AMD 顯示卡加速下載好了，重新開啟拾音後，轉錄就會用顯示卡": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AMD GPU acceleration is ready. Reopen Shiyin and transcription will use the GPU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AMD 顯示卡加速（Vulkan）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AMD GPU acceleration (Vulkan)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API key 存在 Windows 的認證管理員，不會寫進任何檔案。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API keys are stored in Windows Credential Manager and never written to any file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Breeze ASR 25（建議）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Breeze ASR 25 (recommended)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code（這台電腦已經裝了 claude CLI）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code (the claude CLI is installed on this PC)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex（這台電腦已經裝了 codex CLI）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex (the codex CLI is installed on this PC)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NVIDIA 顯示卡加速下載好了，重新開啟拾音後，轉錄就會用顯示卡": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA GPU acceleration is ready. Reopen Shiyin to transcribe on the GPU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NVIDIA 顯示卡加速（CUDA）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA GPU acceleration (CUDA)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NVIDIA 顯示卡加速：轉錄會快很多，685 MB（解開約 1.1 GB）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA GPU acceleration: much faster transcription, 685 MB (about 1.1 GB unpacked)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF 和 docx 的段落標題使用明體；Markdown 適合貼到 Notion、GitHub。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PDF and docx use a serif font for section headings; Markdown is good for pasting into Notion or GitHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen3-ASR 的 AMD 顯示卡加速（Vulkan）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AMD GPU acceleration for Qwen3-ASR (Vulkan)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen3-ASR 的 NVIDIA 顯示卡加速（CUDA）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA GPU acceleration for Qwen3-ASR (CUDA)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen3-ASR 的轉錄程式（llama-server）出錯，請再試一次；一直失敗的話到設定改回 Breeze": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Qwen3-ASR transcription program (llama-server) failed. Try again; if it keeps failing, switch back to Breeze in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WAV 缺少格式區段": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The WAV file has no format chunk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows 解不開 .%@ 的檔案：請先轉成 m4a、mp3 或 wav 再匯入（ogg、opus 可以從 Microsoft Store 安裝「Web 媒體延伸模組」）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Windows can’t decode .%@ files. Convert it to m4a, mp3, or wav and import again (for ogg and opus, install “Web Media Extensions” from the Microsoft Store)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "claude 沒有回傳結果（結束代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "claude returned no result (exit code %lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "codex 沒有回傳結果（結束代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "codex returned no result (exit code %lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「待確認」列出整理時沒把握的人名、專有名詞、負責人和期限。在「你的回答」欄位直接回答，按「送出」，會議紀錄就會依你的答案修正；看不懂或不重要的勾「略過」。也可以在「摘要」按「編輯」直接改。改錯了可以從「更多」選「復原上一版會議紀錄」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“To confirm” lists names, terms, owners and deadlines the summarizer wasn't sure about. Type in “Your answer” and click “Submit”, and the notes are revised from your answers; check “Skip” for anything unclear or unimportant. You can also click “Edit” in “Summary” to change things directly. To undo a mistake, choose “Revert to previous notes” from “More”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「待確認」列出整理時沒把握的人名、專有名詞、負責人和期限。紀錄裡有疑問的那一條旁邊會有「？」，點了就能當場回答；也可以到「待確認」分頁一次看完。能用是或否回答的直接按「是」「不是」（按「是」不用等整理工具），其他的在「你的回答」欄位回答，按「送出」，會議紀錄就會依你的答案修正；看不懂或不重要的按「略過」，或一次「全部略過」。也可以在「摘要」按「編輯」直接改。改錯了可以從「更多」選「復原上一版會議紀錄」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“To confirm” lists the names, terms, owners and deadlines the summarizer wasn’t sure about. The note in question gets a “?” next to it: click it to answer right there, or open the “To confirm” tab to go through them all. Questions that take yes or no have “Yes” and “No” buttons (“Yes” confirms on the spot, no waiting for the summarizer); answer the others in “Your answer”, then click “Submit” and the notes are revised to match. Click “Skip” on anything unclear or unimportant, or “Skip all”. You can also edit the notes directly with “Edit” on the Summary tab. If something goes wrong, choose “Restore previous notes” from “More”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "・匯入：把錄音檔拖進視窗，或按「匯入」（Ctrl+O）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Import: drag a recording into the window, or click Import (Ctrl+O)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "・拾音會常駐在工作列右下角的系統匣，關掉視窗也會繼續錄音和整理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Shiyin stays in the system tray at the bottom right of the taskbar; closing the window keeps recording and processing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "・錄音：側欄上方的「錄音」（Ctrl+R），或在其他 app 裡按 Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Record: click Record at the top of the sidebar (Ctrl+R), or press Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R in any app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下載的壓縮檔裡少了需要的檔案，請重新下載": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The downloaded archive is missing required files. Please download it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下載的檔案不完整": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The download is incomplete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
