      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中文、英文可選的引擎（阿里巴巴開源），約 2.5 GB，含 llama.cpp 的執行檔；「正式轉錄」選了它才會用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional engine for Chinese and English (open-sourced by Alibaba), about 2.5 GB including the llama.cpp program; used only when selected under Final transcription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "之後隨時可以從系統匣或設定的「進階」再打開使用說明。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can open this guide again any time from the system tray or Settings → Advanced."
          }
        }
      }
    },
