    "找不到授權條款的檔案，請重新安裝拾音。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The license file is missing. Please reinstall Shiyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音幫你把會議變成逐字稿和會議紀錄：錄音時就能看到即時逐字稿，錄完會在這台電腦上正式轉錄（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，日文用 Whisper）、分辨說話者，再用 Claude、Codex 或 API 整理成摘要、決議和待辦。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin turns meetings into transcripts and meeting notes: you see a live transcript while recording, then it transcribes on this PC (Breeze ASR 25 for Chinese and English, Whisper for Japanese), tells speakers apart, and uses Claude, Codex or an API to write a summary, decisions and action items."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音把會議變成逐字稿和會議紀錄。錄音、轉錄、說話者辨識都在這台電腦上完成。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin turns meetings into transcripts and meeting notes. Recording, transcription and speaker recognition all happen on this PC."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音是 MIT 授權的開源軟體，用到下列軟體和模型：": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin is open-source software under the MIT License. It uses the following software and models:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音會常駐在工作列右下角的系統匣，關掉視窗也會繼續錄音和整理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin stays in the system tray at the bottom right of the taskbar; recording and processing continue after you close the window."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音會議封包": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin meeting package"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音沒有麥克風的使用權限": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin doesn't have permission to use the microphone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音：正在打開 %@。在那裡登入之後，回到拾音按「重新檢查」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin: opening %@. After you sign in there, come back to Shiyin and click “Check Again”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音：處理中": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin: working"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音：錄音中 %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin: recording %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音：錄音中 %@，%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin: recording %@, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「停止並轉錄」後，拾音會在這台電腦上重新轉錄（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，日文用 Whisper large-v3-turbo），並分辨不同的說話者。等待的時候，會議紀錄會先用即時逐字稿整理一份草稿，正式版好了會自動換掉。逐字稿上點「說話者 1」可以改成人名，整場都會跟著改；拾音會記住這個人的聲音，之後的會議自動帶入名字（標「自動」，認錯了點一下就能改）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After you click Stop and transcribe, Shiyin transcribes again on this PC (Breeze ASR 25 for Chinese and English, Whisper large-v3-turbo for Japanese) and tells the speakers apart. While you wait, a draft of the notes is written from the live transcript and replaced automatically when the final version is ready. Click “Speaker 1” in the transcript to give a real name and the whole meeting updates; Shiyin remembers that voice and fills in the name in later meetings (marked Auto — click it if it's wrong)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「開始使用」後就可以錄音或匯入了。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Get started, then record or import."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按側欄上方的「錄音」（Ctrl+R）開始錄；點按鈕旁的箭頭可以選錄音來源，線上會議請選「麥克風＋電腦聲音（線上會議）」，對方的聲音也會錄進來。已經有錄音檔的話，拖進視窗、按「匯入」（Ctrl+O），或在檔案總管按右鍵用拾音開啟都可以。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Record at the top of the sidebar (Ctrl+R) to start. The arrow next to it chooses the source — for online meetings pick “Microphone + computer audio (online meeting)” so the other side is recorded too. If you already have a recording, drag it into the window, click Import (Ctrl+O), or right-click it in File Explorer and open it with Shiyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "播放": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、提問、猜說話者時會把逐字稿文字、你的筆記、詞彙表和會議基本資料送到這台電腦上的服務（%@），不會離開電腦。錄音檔不會送出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When writing notes, answering questions and guessing speakers, the transcript text, your notes, the glossary and basic meeting info are sent to a service on this PC (%@) and never leave it. Recordings are never sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暫停錄音（Ctrl+Shift+P）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pause recording (Ctrl+Shift+P)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更新金鑰不符": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the update key doesn't match"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "替說話者取名時，拾音會記下這個人的聲音特徵。之後的會議認出同一個人，就自動帶入名字並標「自動」，不對可以改。聲音特徵只存在這台電腦的資料庫，不會上傳，也不會放進匯出的 .shiyin 封包。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you name a speaker, Shiyin saves that person's voice features. When it recognizes the same person in a later meeting, it fills in the name and marks it Auto; you can change it if it's wrong. Voice features stay in the database on this PC — never uploaded and never included in exported .shiyin packages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會參考詞彙表，中英夾雜、專有名詞比較準；需要下載約 1.7 GB 的模型。日文會議改用 Whisper large-v3-turbo（574 MB）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your glossary and handles mixed Chinese and English and proper nouns better; downloads a model of about 1.7 GB. Japanese meetings use Whisper large-v3-turbo (574 MB) instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會參考詞彙表，多人會議的漏字和同音字比 Breeze 少；阿里巴巴開源的模型，全程在這台電腦上跑、不連網，輸出會轉成台灣繁體；需要下載約 2.5 GB 的模型和 llama.cpp 的執行檔。日文會議改用 Whisper large-v3-turbo（574 MB）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your glossary; fewer dropped words and homophone errors than Breeze in multi-speaker meetings. An open-source model from Alibaba that runs entirely on this PC without network access; output is converted to Taiwanese Traditional Chinese. Downloads about 2.5 GB of model files plus the llama.cpp program. Japanese meetings use Whisper large-v3-turbo (574 MB) instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會議可以分資料夾：在會議上按右鍵（或「更多」）選「移到資料夾」→「新資料夾…」。正在看某個資料夾時，新錄的和匯入的會議都會放進去。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meetings can go in folders: right-click a meeting (or use More) and choose Move to folder → New folder…. While you're viewing a folder, new recordings and imports go into it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會議日期：依各檔案的檔名或修改日期": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeting date: from each file's name or modification date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 AMD 顯示卡、選了 Qwen3-ASR 時自動下載，Qwen 改用顯示卡轉錄。%@，解開約 %@（llama.cpp 官方的 Vulkan 版）。刪除後不會再自動下載。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded automatically when this PC has an AMD GPU and Qwen3-ASR is selected, so Qwen transcribes on the GPU. %@, about %@ unpacked (the official llama.cpp Vulkan build). Once deleted, it won’t be downloaded again automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 AMD 顯示卡時自動下載，正式轉錄改用顯示卡。%@，解開約 %@（拾音用同一版 whisper.cpp 建的 Vulkan 版）。刪除後不會再自動下載。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded automatically when this PC has an AMD GPU, so final transcription runs on the GPU. %@, about %@ unpacked (a Vulkan build Shiyin makes from the same whisper.cpp version). Once deleted, it won’t be downloaded again automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 NVIDIA 顯示卡、選了 Qwen3-ASR 時自動下載，Qwen 的轉錄會快很多。272 MB，解開約 610 MB（llama.cpp 官方的 CUDA 版，要先有上面的 NVIDIA 顯示卡加速）。刪除後不會再自動下載。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded automatically when you have an NVIDIA GPU and choose Qwen3-ASR; makes Qwen transcription much faster. 272 MB, about 610 MB unpacked (the official llama.cpp CUDA build; requires the NVIDIA GPU acceleration above). It is not downloaded again after you delete it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 NVIDIA 顯示卡時自動下載，轉錄會快很多。685 MB，解開約 1.1 GB（whisper.cpp 官方的 CUDA 版）。刪除後不會再自動下載。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded automatically when an NVIDIA GPU is present; transcription is much faster. 685 MB, about 1.1 GB unpacked (the official CUDA build of whisper.cpp). Once deleted, it won't be downloaded automatically again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "標記這個時間點（Ctrl+B），整理時會被當成重點": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mark this moment (Ctrl+B); it's treated as a highlight when writing notes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型只需要下載一次，之後轉錄都不需要網路。可以先按「下一步」，在背景繼續下載；快速辨識的模型下載好就能錄音，正式轉錄的模型下載好之前先用快速辨識。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Models only need to be downloaded once; transcription works offline after that. You can click Next and let them download in the background. Once the quick recognition model is ready you can record, and Quick recognition is used until the transcription model is ready."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在下載%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloading %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沒辦法刪除認證管理員裡的 key（錯誤代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't delete the key from Credential Manager (error %lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沒辦法執行 %@ 附的 codex（%@）。可以另外安裝 Codex CLI（npm install -g @openai/codex）再試。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't run the codex bundled with %@ (%@). You can install Codex CLI (npm install -g @openai/codex) and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沒辦法把 key 存進認證管理員（錯誤代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't save the key to Credential Manager (error %lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沒辦法註冊 Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R：%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't register Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沒辦法註冊快捷鍵（錯誤代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't register the shortcut (error %lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沒辦法讀取「%@」（Media Foundation 錯誤代碼 0x%@）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't read “%1$@” (Media Foundation error 0x%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "版本 %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登入公司的企業伺服器時：錄音會上傳到公司自己的伺服器轉錄和辨識說話者，不經過其他雲端服務，轉完就刪，聲紋不存在伺服器；選「公司」整理時，逐字稿送到公司的伺服器，由公司選的模型整理（公司機房裡的模型，或公司接的 AI 服務）。公司的後台只看得到用量的數字（幾分鐘、幾次），看不到會議內容。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you’re signed in to your company’s enterprise server: recordings are uploaded to your company’s own server for transcription and speaker identification, without passing through any other cloud service, and deleted once transcribed; voiceprints aren’t kept on the server. With the “Company” summarizer, the transcript goes to your company’s server and is summarized by the model your company chose (one in its own data center, or an AI service it uses). The company’s admin console shows only usage numbers (minutes, counts), never meeting content."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "目前不整理：錄音、轉錄、逐字稿全部留在這台電腦。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes are off: recordings, transcription and transcripts all stay on this PC."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "繼續錄音（Ctrl+Shift+P）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resume recording (Ctrl+Shift+P)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聲紋（說話者的聲音特徵，一組數字，不是錄音）只存在這台電腦，不會放進匯出的 .shiyin 封包。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voiceprints (a speaker's voice features: a list of numbers, not audio) stay on this PC and are never included in exported .shiyin packages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要先安裝並登入對應的 CLI。登入後可以在「設定 → 整理工具」按「測試整理工具」確認。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install and sign in to the CLI first. Then click Test in Settings → Notes engine to check it works."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "覺得拾音好用的話，可以請我喝杯咖啡。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enjoying Shiyin? Buy me a coffee."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者分得太少（人多、吵雜、手機放在桌上遠距收音）時，從「更多 → 重新處理」選「重新辨識說話者…」，告訴拾音大約幾個人。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If too few speakers were found (many people, noisy room, a phone on the table far from the speakers), choose More → Reprocess → Re-identify Speakers… and tell Shiyin roughly how many people there were."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者分得太少（人多、吵雜、手機放在桌上遠距收音）時，從「更多」選「重新辨識說話者…」，告訴拾音大約幾個人。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If too few speakers were found (many people, noise, a phone on the table), choose More → Re-identify speakers… and tell Shiyin roughly how many people there were."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者分錯了：同一個人被分成兩位，點說話者的名字選「合併到…」；某幾句分錯人，在逐字稿按右鍵選「這句是誰說的」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If speakers are wrong: when one person was split into two, click the speaker's name and choose Merge into…; when a few lines have the wrong speaker, right-click them in the transcript and choose Who said this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者辨識模型：分辨是誰在說話，約 46 MB": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speaker recognition model: tells who is speaking, about 46 MB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者辨識用，約 46 MB。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used for speaker recognition, about 46 MB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者辨識的模型還在下載，下載好後再試一次": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The speaker recognition model is still downloading. Try again when it's ready"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "請到「設定 → 隱私權與安全性 → 麥克風」打開「麥克風存取」和「讓傳統型應用程式存取您的麥克風」，再重新開始錄音。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go to Settings → Privacy & security → Microphone, turn on “Microphone access” and “Let desktop apps access your microphone”, then start recording again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "讀不到認證管理員裡的 key（錯誤代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't read the key from Credential Manager (error %lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "超過 15 秒沒有收到電腦的聲音：請確認線上會議有聲音在播": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No computer audio for over 15 seconds: check that the online meeting is playing sound"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "跟著 Windows": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Same as Windows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉成逐字稿：在這台電腦上轉錄、分辨說話者，不會上傳。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcribe: transcription and speaker identification run on this PC; nothing is uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完成、會議紀錄整理好時通知你。已允許。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifies you when transcription and meeting notes are done. Allowed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完成、會議紀錄整理好時通知你。通知被關掉時，可以在 Windows 的「系統 → 通知」打開。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifies you when transcription and meeting notes are done. If notifications are off, turn them on in Windows Settings → System → Notifications."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完成後把錄音壓縮成 m4a（約每小時 43 MB）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compress recordings to m4a after transcription (about 43 MB per hour)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完會自動整理。「摘要」有重點、決議、待辦和未決問題；「詳細」依議題分段；每一條後面的時間點點一下，就從錄音那裡開始播放。範本選單可以換成一對一、訪談、課堂／演講、腦力激盪等格式，換完從「更多」選「重新整理會議紀錄」。想找某件事，可以在「提問」分頁直接問，回答會附上時間點；側欄上方的提問按鈕可以一次問所有會議。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes are written automatically after transcription. Summary has key points, decisions, action items and open questions; Details is split by topic; click the time after any item to play the recording from there. The template menu switches to formats like one-on-one, interview, lecture or brainstorm — then choose More → Regenerate meeting notes. To find something, ask in the Ask tab and the answer comes with timestamps; the Ask button at the top of the sidebar asks all meetings at once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完會自動整理。「紀錄」分頁由上而下是摘要、決議、待辦、未決問題和依議題分段的討論；每一條後面的時間點點一下，就從錄音那裡開始播放。範本選單可以換成一對一、訪談、課堂／演講、腦力激盪等格式，換完從「更多 → 重新處理」選「重新整理會議紀錄」。想找某件事，可以在「提問」分頁直接問，回答會附上時間點；側欄上方的提問按鈕可以一次問所有會議。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes are generated automatically after transcription. The Notes tab shows, from top to bottom, the summary, decisions, action items, open questions, and the discussion by topic; click the timestamp after any item to play the recording from there. The template menu switches to formats such as one-on-one, interview, lecture, or brainstorming; afterwards choose More → Reprocess → Regenerate Notes. To find something, ask in the Ask tab and the answer comes with timestamps; the Ask button above the sidebar asks across all meetings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄模型下載中 %lld%%，下載好之前先用快速辨識轉錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription model %lld%% downloaded; fast recognition is used until it finishes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄模型還沒下載好，會先用快速辨識轉錄；可以到「設定 → 錄音與轉錄」下載，用模型轉錄比較準。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transcription model is not downloaded yet, so fast recognition is used for now. You can download it in Settings → Recording & Transcription; the model is more accurate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄正在用這個元件，重新開啟拾音後才能刪除": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription is using this component. Reopen Shiyin to delete it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄（快速辨識）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcribing (quick recognition)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄：錄音會送到 %@（公司的伺服器），轉完就刪。說話者辨識也在伺服器上做，聲紋只存在這台電腦；筆記、會議紀錄不會因為轉錄送出。伺服器用的轉錄引擎：%@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription: recordings are sent to %1$@ (your company's server) and deleted after transcription. Speakers are also identified on the server; voiceprints stay on this computer, and notes and meeting notes are not sent for transcription. Transcription engine on the server: %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個格式在這裡不能匯出": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This format can't be exported here"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個版本沒有更新金鑰（開發版），不會檢查更新。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This build has no update key (development build), so it doesn't check for updates."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦已經用 %@ 登入 %@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This PC is signed in as %@ on %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦找不到 Claude Code（命令列版）。Claude 桌面版不能直接用，請到設定 → 整理工具照說明安裝 Claude Code；或改用 API（填 API key）、選「不整理」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code (the command-line version) isn't installed on this PC. The Claude desktop app can't be used directly: go to Settings → Summarizer and follow the steps to install Claude Code, or choose an API (with an API key) or “Don't summarize”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦找不到 claude。沒有在用 Claude Code 的話，請到設定 → 整理工具改用 API（填 API key）或選「不整理」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "claude isn't installed on this PC. If you don't use Claude Code, go to Settings → Summarizer and choose an API (with an API key) or “Don't summarize”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦找不到 codex。沒有在用 Codex 的話，請到設定 → 整理工具改用 API（填 API key）或選「不整理」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "codex isn't installed on this PC. If you don't use Codex, go to Settings → Summarizer and choose an API (with an API key) or “Don't summarize”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦沒有 Claude Code 或 Codex。要用 AI 整理會議紀錄，選一個 API 並貼上 API key（有取得 key 的連結）；也可以之後再設定，錄音和逐字稿照常能用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This PC doesn't have Claude Code or Codex. To have AI write your meeting notes, choose an API and paste an API key (there's a link to get one). You can also set this up later; recording and transcripts work either way."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦沒有安裝 Claude Code（命令列版），安裝方法在下面": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code (the command-line version) isn't installed on this PC. See how to install it below"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦沒有安裝 claude：沒有在用 Claude Code 的話，請改選 API": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "claude isn't installed on this PC. If you don't use Claude Code, choose an API instead"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦沒有安裝 codex：沒有在用 Codex 的話，請改選 API": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "codex isn't installed on this PC. If you don't use Codex, choose an API instead"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這場會議是在模型下載好之前，用快速辨識轉錄的。可以用 Breeze 重新轉錄，通常比較準。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This meeting was transcribed with Quick recognition before the model finished downloading. Re-transcribing with Breeze is usually more accurate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這場會議是在模型下載好之前，用快速辨識轉錄的。可以用日文轉錄模型重新轉錄，通常比較準。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This meeting was transcribed with Quick recognition before the model finished downloading. Re-transcribing with the Japanese model is usually more accurate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這組快捷鍵已經被別的 app 用了": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Another app is already using this shortcut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "速度快很多，下載也小；但不參考詞彙表，英文專有名詞、人名比較容易錯。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Much faster with a small download, but it ignores the glossary, so English terms and names are more often wrong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "連線逾時": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection timed out"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "逾時": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "timed out"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "遇到問題，可以從設定的「進階」選「回報問題…」，會附上版本和環境（不含會議內容）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If something goes wrong, choose Report a problem… in Settings → Advanced; it includes the version and environment (no meeting content)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒設定整理工具：錄音、轉錄、逐字稿全部留在這台電腦。選好整理工具之後，才會整理成會議紀錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No summarizer is set up yet: recordings, transcription and transcripts all stay on this PC. Meeting notes are created once you choose a summarizer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新打開拾音後換成新的介面語言": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The new interface language takes effect after you reopen Shiyin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄現場會議或你自己的聲音。Windows 的「隱私權與安全性 → 麥克風」要允許桌面 app 使用麥克風。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records in-person meetings or your own voice. In Windows Settings → Privacy & security → Microphone, desktop apps must be allowed to use the microphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄線上會議時選「麥克風＋電腦聲音」：你的聲音和對方的聲音會分別錄在左右聲道。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For online meetings choose “Microphone + computer audio”: your voice and the other side are recorded on the left and right channels."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄線上會議（Zoom、Meet、Teams）對方的聲音。Windows 不用另外允許，錄音時選「麥克風＋電腦聲音」就好。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records the other side of online meetings (Zoom, Meet, Teams). Windows needs no extra permission — just choose “Microphone + computer audio” when recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音、逐字稿和會議紀錄都只存在這台電腦上（%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Shiyin），不會跟著帳號漫遊。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings, transcripts and meeting notes are stored only on this PC (%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Shiyin) and don't roam with your account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中按 Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B 標記重點（在其他 app 裡也能用）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While recording, press Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B to mark a highlight (works in any app)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中畫面左邊是即時逐字稿，講完幾秒內就會出現；右邊「我的筆記」每換一行會自動記下當時的錄音時間。重要的地方按「標記重點」（Ctrl+B），在其他 app 裡也可以按 Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B。需要中斷時按「暫停」（Ctrl+Shift+P），暫停的時間不會錄進去。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While recording, the live transcript is on the left and appears a few seconds after each sentence; each new line in My notes on the right gets the recording time. Click Mark highlight (Ctrl+B) for important moments, or press Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B in any app. Click Pause (Ctrl+Shift+P) to stop for a while; paused time isn't recorded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中畫面左邊是即時逐字稿，講完幾秒內就會出現；右邊「我的筆記」每換一行會自動記下當時的錄音時間（錄完在逐字稿分頁頂部的「我的筆記」還能改）。重要的地方按「標記重點」（Ctrl+B），在其他 app 裡也可以按 Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B。需要中斷時按「暫停」（Ctrl+Shift+P），暫停的時間不會錄進去。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While recording, the live transcript appears on the left within seconds of each sentence; My Notes on the right stamps the recording time whenever you start a new line (after recording you can still edit them under My Notes at the top of the Transcript tab). Press Bookmark (Ctrl+B) at important moments, or Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B from any other app. Press Pause (Ctrl+Shift+P) when you need a break; paused time is not recorded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音和轉錄都只在這台電腦上進行，不會上傳。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording and transcription happen only on this PC and are never uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音會送到 %@（公司的伺服器）轉錄，轉完就刪；說話者辨識也在伺服器上做，聲紋只存在這台電腦。會參考詞彙表。連不上時會等，也可以改在這台電腦轉錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings are sent to %@ (your company's server) for transcription and deleted afterwards; speakers are identified on the server too, and voiceprints stay on this computer. Uses the glossary. If the server can't be reached, Shiyin waits, or you can transcribe on this computer instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開 Zoom、Teams、Google Meet 等線上會議時，拾音會提醒你開始錄音；會議好像結束時提醒停止。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When an online meeting starts in Zoom, Teams, Google Meet and so on, Shiyin reminds you to record, and reminds you to stop when it seems to have ended."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開始錄音（Ctrl+R），用%@辨識；點右邊的箭頭可以改錄音來源和語言": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start recording (Ctrl+R), recognizing %@; click the arrow on the right to change the source and language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "關於拾音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About Shiyin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "電腦聲音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Computer audio"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
